{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04568","headline":"再使蜀道 · 张说","name":"再使蜀道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眇眇葭萌道，苍苍褒斜谷。\n烟壑争晦深，云山共重复。\n古来风尘子，同眩望乡目。\n芸阁有儒生，轺车倦驰逐。\n青春客岷岭，白露摇江服。\n岁月镇羁孤，山川俄反覆。\n鱼游恋深水，鸟迁恋乔木。\n如何别亲爱，坐去文章国。\n蟋蟀鸣户庭，蟏蛸网琴筑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}